  "description": "A packed 2x2 sietch planter of hauled fines and catchment grit. Four crop cells share one tray and one water reserve. Colonists haul physical water rations into the tray; crops drink only when they actually grow. Grow Gift to the Thirsty, Pundi rice, Fremen wheat, alfalfa, evening primrose, or sietch fiber here. A full fiber harvest can be woven into twenty-four cloth at a sietch tailoring bench. Beds need no power and cannot grow vanilla offworld cultivars.",
